<article class="env-lemma" id="0D4J">
  <p><a class="environment-identifier" href="/tag/0D4J">Lemma <span data-tag="0D4J">37.30.6</span>.</a> Let $f : X \to Y$ be a proper, flat morphism of schemes of finite presentation. Let $n_{X/Y}$ be the function on $Y$ giving the dimension of fibres of $f$ introduced in Lemma <a href="/tag/05F8" data-tag="05F8">37.30.2</a>. Then $n_{X/Y}$ is locally constant. </p>
</article><article class="env-proof">
    <p>
      <strong>Proof.</strong>
      Immediate consequence of Lemmas <a href="/tag/0D4H" data-tag="0D4H">37.30.4</a> and <a href="/tag/0D4I" data-tag="0D4I">37.30.5</a>. 
      <span class="qed">$\square$</span>
    </p>
</article>